Version: 1.2
-------------------------
Features and changes:
=====================

1. Change in communication between DM and WS message format to update thing to tronX.
2. Update observed response from DM to tronX and local database.
3. Add discovered devices to local database.
4. Shifu things local database to perform following action
    a. add thing,
    b. remove thing,
    c. update thing,
    d. get things and
    e. get things details.
5. Update in acknowledgement to tronX socket io server to control devices.
6. Offline API for development team to get things list and control devices.

Outstanding issues / features pending:
=====================================

1. Multiple control and scene
2. Rules
#13966	SHIFU	Feature	        Multiple Device control support for Group and... (New)
#13963	SHIFU	Feature	        Rules Data Sync for for CRUD operation (sqlite3 local Shifu Database)
#13960	SHIFU	Feature	        Device Manager Error Handling (New)
#13959	SHIFU	Feature	        Remove things functionality in Web Socket (New)

Version: 1.1
-------------------------

Features and changes:
=====================

1. Improved LED Feature for discovery and connected.
2. New things structure as according to visual design.
3. Add discovered devices to cloud with new things Structure using single Thread.
4. Logger formating to debug WS-DM communication.
5. Internal improvement
	a. Memory leake
	b. Request and response
6. WORKAROUND: after onboarding you needs to restart web socket service (cd /etc/init.d && ./ws_service restart) to update new token in WS.

Outstanding issues / features pending:
=====================================
1. WORKAROUND: after onboarding service manager needs to restart web socket service.
