Version: 1.0
-------------------------

Features and changes:
=====================
1. Single Device Control
2. Discovery (Devices List Can be fetched from Device Manager Changelog)
3. Discovery timeout
4. Multiple client Request
5. Command through SocketIO Client
6. Communication through message Id with Device Manager
7. Process mapping and removal of message Id
8. SocketIO Client thread to recieve tronX message
9. SocketIO and Web Socket core will start as thread


Outstanding issues / features pending:
=====================================
1. LED Feature (Review and Testing)
2. Removal Device (In Progress)
3. Local and Cloud Db Update using single Thread (In progress)
4. Scene and Group Control (NEW)
5. Rules Creation, Updation (NEW)
6. Rules Execution (NEW)
7. Observation Method (NEW)

Redmine Ids:
#13892 	SHIFU 	Feature 	LED feature for Web Socket (Review)
#13847  Shifu   Feature     CMD tool for Web Socket services and tweaking control

Installation guide:
===================
1. select Web Socket package in makemenuconfig to install with image, olternatively can be installed using setup.py file (located in src folder of Web Socket) using `python setup.py install` command

System requirements:
====================
zmq and pyzmq
python 2.7
python packages (will be installed in package building)
	'requests>=2.7.0',
    'pyzmq>=16.0.0',
	'socketIO-client==0.7.2'

Troubleshooting/Logs:
=====================
1. Logger is Implemented with 5 levels(debug, info, warn, error, critical)

